style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">현재는 \n            사용하지 못한다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물리력 \n            공격과 방어력이 모두 수준 이하인 이들은 초보 여행자라도 이들의 거대한 \n            </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">덩치에 \n            겁먹지 않는다면 쉽게 처리할 수 있을 정도이다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img bor